[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    107[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// SplitMix64. Self-contained so the tests need no extra dependency and the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// sequence is stable across platforms and toolchains.
