[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    451[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Row 53 — struct-ABI parity sweep. Every export is called with recognisable
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    452[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// sentinel bit patterns in every field of every by-value struct, so a
